=2 Walkthrough
* You must defeat 3 {p:NIN} NMs: Oko, Danzo and Saizo. They will each leave behind a ??? after their corpse has faded, the last of which will be the OGMA, which when retrieved will spawn the Rune of Release.
** Oko and Danzo both dual wield katanas, while Saizo uses a great katana and can also use Mijin Gakure. Oko and Saizo both have a Kusa very nearby them, which you should probably attempt to pull first if you don't have a way to sleep the Kusa.
* The {p:Rune of Release} will spawn on the border of (G-8) and (H-8) on the __lower__ level. It will be right under a drop-down from the top level.

=3 Notes
* The 3 NMs and the Kusa are humanoid ninjas, they will self buff with utsusemi while idle, cast ninjutsu and use {p:Katana} or {p:Great Katana} Weaponskills. They aggro true sight.
* All mobs in this assault seem to resist drain type effects.
* Kusa are susceptible to lullaby and other light-based sleeps.
* The Kudagitsunes are {m:Bhoots|Bhoot}, which are aggressive to sound and low health. On aggro they will immediately use Perdition if you are in range; Perdition range seems to be about 10'. If you are out of range they will cast a spell, then use Perdition once in range.
** Perdition is an instant death ability that can kill you even if you are high level!

